Therefore, the matching efficiency includes the TOF detectors acceptance, the response efficiency and the material absorption effect.

Fig. 3.11 and Fig. 3.12 show the TOF matching efficiency of \(\pi^{\pm}\), \(p\) and \(\bar{p}\) as a function of \(p_{T}\) in different centrality bins.

